; Two clients show one view of a 300-line buffer: a desktop 20 lines
; high and a phone 10 lines high, each line 20 pixels. Before a page has
; reported, its client is drawn 100 lines beyond each edge, and a spacer
; counts the lines past them; a new client is placed where the view is.
> (define b (buffers:make "long" (lines 300)))
> (define v (views:make b))
